{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Theta is a little girl who turns left every time she hits a wall. She is curious about the world and discovers a mysterious place, where she picked up a fork that can split her into multiple copies of herself, and from that moment, the world changes forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/extras/TPW1.gif?t=1744717483\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of one or multiple overly agile heroine in puzzle games\uff0cuse the power of splitting to solve puzzles and explore the truth of a world under the observation of &quot;God&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/extras/TPW2.gif?t=1744717483\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is expected to feature 6 main chapters, each revealing at least one hidden truth that already hides within the core mechanics of the game from the beginning. Paralldoxs are under your nose!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By experiencing some abstract interpretations of modern physics, you will uncover the creation and operation of parallel worlds and other rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/extras/TPW5.gif?t=1744717483\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 200 handcrafted puzzles, along with meta puzzles that requires power of changing the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/extras/\u5c4f\u5e55\u622a\u56fe_2025-03-25_211922.png?t=1744717483\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HInt system and Notebook : You can look up the knowledge you've learnt, or think about the essence of current level in Theta's dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/extras/TPW7.gif?t=1744717483\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can play most of levels in Prologue and Chapter 1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And have a peek at the  Paralldoxs and Other Mysteries at the end by experiencing some levels from latter Chapters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522000?t=1744717483","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522000?t=1744717483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/5f148e654f4308203926041bed94051c19d71567/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744717483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/5f148e654f4308203926041bed94051c19d71567/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744717483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Theta is a little girl who turns left every time she hits a wall. She is curious about the world and discovers a mysterious place, where she picked up a fork that can split her into multiple copies of herself, and from that moment, the world changes forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522000/extras/TPW1.gif?t=1744717483\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of one or multiple overly agile heroine in puzzle games\uff0cuse 